Z||000017||Philphine||06-05-2001||07:32 PM||||krispy kreme's been around as long as i can remember here with quite a few locations so i've never had to wait beyond a couple of people. they are good though. i never get more than 3 or 4 'cause i want them as fresh as possible. if i wanted more (dought that i could take more than that anyway), i'd go back later.||||reg||1
